},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[58,64,58,64,58,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[58,64,58,64,58,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[58,64,58,64,58,62],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[58,64,58,64,58,62],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ1010502","city":"CS1068","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[58,64,58,64,58,62],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1015205","helmet":"WP1024405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"百济第十一代国王，为仇首王次子、沙伴王之弟，因汾西王遭暗杀且其子年幼，永兴元年被臣民拥立继位。在位期间推行军事改革，任命解仇掌军权，在宫殿西侧建射台并开展定期军事训练。镇压庶弟佐平优福在北汉山城发动的叛乱。东晋咸和六年百济遭遇大旱，咸康三年新罗遣使来访。东晋建元二年病逝，由汾西王之子契王继位。","tc":"百濟第十一代國王，為仇首王次子、沙伴王之弟，因汾西王遭暗殺且其子年幼，永興元年被臣民擁立繼位。在位期間推行軍事改革，任命解仇掌軍權，在宮殿西側建射臺并開展定期軍事訓練。鎮壓庶弟佐平優福在北漢山城發動的叛亂。東晉咸和六年百濟遭遇大旱，咸康三年新羅遣使來訪。東晉建元二年病逝，由汾西王之子契王繼位。","en":"The 11th king of Baekje, second son of King Gusu and younger brother of King Saban. After King Bunseo was assassinated and because Bunseo's son was still young, Biryu was enthroned by the ministers and people in the first year of Yongxing. During his reign, he implemented military reforms, appointing Hae Gu to oversee military affairs, building an archery range west of the palace, and conducting regular military training. He suppressed a rebellion launched at Bukhansan Fortress by his younger half-brother, Jwapyeong U Bok. In the sixth year of Xianhe of Eastern Jin, Baekje suffered a severe drought, in the third year of Xiankang, Silla sent an envoy to visit. In the second year of Jianyuan of Eastern Jin, he died of illness and was succeeded by King Bunseo's son, King Gye.","jp":"百済第11代国王。仇首王の次男で、沙伴王の弟にあたる。汾西王が暗殺された際にその子が幼少であったため、永興元年に臣民に推戴されて即位した。在位中は軍事改革を推し進め、解仇を登用して軍権を委ね、宮殿の西側に射台を設けて定期的な軍事訓練を実施した。また、庶弟である佐平の優福が北漢山城で起こした反乱を鎮圧した。東晋の咸和6年に百済は大干ばつに見舞われ、咸康3年には新羅より使者が来訪した。東晋の建元2年に病没し、汾西王の子である契王が跡を継いだ。","kr":"백제 제11대 국왕으로 구수왕의 차남이자 사반왕의 아우이다. 분서왕이 암살당하고 그 아들이 어리자, 영흥 원년에 신민들의 추대를 받아 즉위했다. 재위 기간 군사 개혁을 추진하여 해구에게 군권을 맡기고 궁궐 서쪽에 사대를 세워 정기적인 군사 훈련을 실시했다. 서제인 좌평 우복이 북한산성에서 일으킨 반란을 진압했다. 동진 함화 6년에 백제에 큰 가뭄이 들었으며, 함강 3년에는 신라에서 사신을 보내왔다. 동진 건원 2년에 병사하자 분서왕의 아들 계왕이 뒤를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1051015","remark":"普武","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"比流","nameTc":"比流","nameEn":"Biryu","nameJp":"比流","nameKr":"비류","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"比流","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":